{"id":"al-que-quiere","title":"Al Que Quiere!","author":"William Carlos Williams","year":"1917","note":"Williams’s early free-verse address to American speech, streets, and local seeing.\n\nTo-him-who-wants-it local heat — early WCW ditching meter for street-level American sensation.\n\nThis Vellum sitting edition keeps the work readable without academic apparatus — no footnotes theater, just the text and enough context to open the door.\n\nUS public-domain text reused from cleaned editorial source (Al-Que-Quiere-William-Carlos-Williams-1917.txt). Light editorial cleanup for readability; wording and dialogue preserved.","minutes":225,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Sub Terra","place":"Sub Terra","reentry":"Where shall I find you,","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s1","title":"Mimicking","place":"Mimicking","reentry":"onto the lawns of the rich!","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s2","title":"Pastoral","place":"Pastoral","reentry":"When I was younger","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s3","title":"Chickory and Daisies","place":"Chickory and Daisies","reentry":"I.","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s4","title":"II","place":"II","reentry":"I saw a child with daisies","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where shall I find you,"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"you my grotesque fellows"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"that I seek everywhere"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"to make up my band?"},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"None, not one"},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"with the earthy tastes I require;"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"the burrowing pride that rises"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"subtly as on a bush in May."},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where are you this day,"},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"you my seven year locusts"},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"with cased wings?"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"Ah my beauties how I long--!"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"That harvest"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"that shall be your advent--"},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"thrusting up through the grass,"},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"up under the weeds"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"answering me,"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"_that_ shall be satisfying!"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"The light shall leap and snap"},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"that day as with a million lashes!"},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"Oh, I have you; yes"},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"you are about me in a sense:"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"playing under the blue pools"},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"that are my windows,--"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"but they shut you out still,"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"there in the half light."},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"For the simple truth is"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"that though I see you clear enough"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"you are not there!"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"It is not that--it is you,"},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"you I want!"},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"--God, if I could fathom"},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"the guts of shadows!"},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"You to come with me"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"poking into negro houses"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"with their gloom and smell!"},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"In among children"},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"leaping around a dead dog!"},{"id":"s1-0","sceneId":"s1","text":"onto the lawns of the rich!"},{"id":"s1-1","sceneId":"s1","text":"You!"},{"id":"s1-2","sceneId":"s1","text":"to go with me a-tip-toe,"},{"id":"s1-3","sceneId":"s1","text":"head down under heaven,"},{"id":"s1-4","sceneId":"s1","text":"nostrils lipping the wind!"},{"id":"s2-0","sceneId":"s2","text":"When I was younger"},{"id":"s2-1","sceneId":"s2","text":"it was plain to me"},{"id":"s2-2","sceneId":"s2","text":"I must make something of myself."},{"id":"s2-3","sceneId":"s2","text":"Older now"},{"id":"s2-4","sceneId":"s2","text":"I walk back streets"},{"id":"s2-5","sceneId":"s2","text":"admiring the houses"},{"id":"s2-6","sceneId":"s2","text":"of the very poor:"},{"id":"s2-7","sceneId":"s2","text":"roof out of line with sides"},{"id":"s2-8","sceneId":"s2","text":"the yards cluttered"},{"id":"s2-9","sceneId":"s2","text":"with old chicken wire, ashes,"},{"id":"s2-10","sceneId":"s2","text":"furniture gone wrong;"},{"id":"s2-11","sceneId":"s2","text":"the fences and outhouses"},{"id":"s2-12","sceneId":"s2","text":"built of barrel-staves"},{"id":"s2-13","sceneId":"s2","text":"and parts of boxes, all,"},{"id":"s2-14","sceneId":"s2","text":"if I am fortunate,"},{"id":"s2-15","sceneId":"s2","text":"smeared a bluish green"},{"id":"s2-16","sceneId":"s2","text":"that properly weathered"},{"id":"s2-17","sceneId":"s2","text":"pleases me best"},{"id":"s2-18","sceneId":"s2","text":"of all colors."},{"id":"s2-19","sceneId":"s2","text":"No one"},{"id":"s2-20","sceneId":"s2","text":"will believe this"},{"id":"s2-21","sceneId":"s2","text":"of vast import to the nation."},{"id":"s3-0","sceneId":"s3","text":"I."},{"id":"s3-1","sceneId":"s3","text":"Lift your flowers"},{"id":"s3-2","sceneId":"s3","text":"on bitter stems"},{"id":"s3-3","sceneId":"s3","text":"chickory!"},{"id":"s3-4","sceneId":"s3","text":"Lift them up"},{"id":"s3-5","sceneId":"s3","text":"out of the scorched ground!"},{"id":"s3-6","sceneId":"s3","text":"Bear no foliage"},{"id":"s3-7","sceneId":"s3","text":"but give yourself"},{"id":"s3-8","sceneId":"s3","text":"wholly to that!"},{"id":"s3-9","sceneId":"s3","text":"Strain under them"},{"id":"s3-10","sceneId":"s3","text":"you bitter stems"},{"id":"s3-11","sceneId":"s3","text":"that no beast eats--"},{"id":"s3-12","sceneId":"s3","text":"and scorn greyness!"},{"id":"s3-13","sceneId":"s3","text":"Into the heat with them:"},{"id":"s3-14","sceneId":"s3","text":"cool!"},{"id":"s3-15","sceneId":"s3","text":"luxuriant! sky-blue!"},{"id":"s3-16","sceneId":"s3","text":"The earth cracks and"},{"id":"s3-17","sceneId":"s3","text":"is shriveled up;"},{"id":"s3-18","sceneId":"s3","text":"the wind moans piteously;"},{"id":"s3-19","sceneId":"s3","text":"the sky goes out"},{"id":"s3-20","sceneId":"s3","text":"if you should fail."},{"id":"s4-0","sceneId":"s4","text":"I saw a child with daisies"},{"id":"s4-1","sceneId":"s4","text":"for weaving into the hair"},{"id":"s4-2","sceneId":"s4","text":"tear the stems"}]}